config
.
. Phase 6a Leitzentrale subsystem config for Sponge OS.
.
. Modeled on genode/repos/gems/sculpt/leitzentrale/default (the proven
. Sculpt subsystem template) with two differences, both documented per
. AGENTS.md §5.4:
.
.   1. The model/report/font file-system servers live INSIDE this subsystem
.      (in Sculpt they are siblings of the leitzentrale child at the
.      "option" level). Co-locating them removes cross-init File_system
.      routing and the 'identity:' relabeling dance — fewer moving parts
.      for the headless boot. The fs_rom label-to-path mapping uses only
.      the label's last element, so the 'model -> ...' / 'report -> ...'
.      ROM labels still resolve to the right files regardless of how many
.      init levels they crossed.
.
.   2. A <report> element is added so lz_probe (a sibling under lz_runtime)
.      can observe this subsystem's sandbox state via the lz_relay
.      report_rom and confirm that the 'manager' child (sculpt_manager) is
.      running. This is the Phase 6a alive check; window visibility is 6b.
.
. Everything else mirrors sculpt/leitzentrale/default exactly:
. fader_config -> fader -> gui_fb -> nitpicker compositor, with wm,
. themed_decorator, backdrop, and the sculpt_manager providing the dialog
. Gui. leitzentrale_enabled is seeded to 'no', so gui_fader holds alpha 0
. (the subsystem composites nothing onto the outer nitpicker — headless).
.
+ parent-provides
  + service ROM
  + service PD
  + service RM
  + service CPU
  + service LOG
  + service Report
  + service Gui
  + service Timer
+ default-route | + any-service | + parent
+ default | caps: 100 | ram: 1M
+ report | init_ram: yes | child_ram: yes | child_caps: yes | delay_ms: 500

.
. Route the sculpt_manager's 'model -> ...' ROM reads to the in-subsystem
. model_rom. fs_rom maps the label's last element to a file path, so
. '... -> model -> deploy' resolves to file /deploy. The explicit
. label_prefix route keeps the policy self-documenting.
.
+ service ROM | label_prefix: model ->  | + child model_rom
+ service ROM | label_prefix: report -> | + child report_fs_rom
+ service ROM | label_suffix: lz_config | + parent
+ service Report | label_suffix: lz_model | + parent

.
. ---- File-system servers (Sponge co-location; see header note 1) ----
.

+ start model_fs | caps: 200 | ram: 64M
  + binary vfs
  + provides | + service File_system
  + config
    + vfs
    | + ram
    | + import
    |   + tar model.tar
    + default-policy | root: / | writeable: yes

+ start model_rom | caps: 100 | ram: 16M
  + binary fs_rom
  + provides | + service ROM
  + route
    + service File_system | + child model_fs
    + any-service         | + parent

+ start report_fs | ram: 16M
  + binary vfs
  + provides | + service File_system
  + config
    + vfs | + ram
    + default-policy | root: / | writeable: yes

+ start report_fs_rom | caps: 100 | ram: 8M
  + binary fs_rom
  + provides | + service ROM
  + route
    + service File_system | + child report_fs
    + any-service         | + parent

+ start font | caps: 150 | ram: 8M
  + binary vfs
  + provides | + service File_system
  + config
    + vfs
    | + rom Vera.ttf
    | + rom VeraMono.ttf
    | + dir font
    |   + dir title      | + ttf regular | path: /Vera.ttf     | size_px: 18 | cache: 256K
    |   + dir text       | + ttf regular | path: /Vera.ttf     | size_px: 14 | cache: 256K
    |   + dir annotation | + ttf regular | path: /Vera.ttf     | size_px: 11 | cache: 256K
    |   + dir monospace  | + ttf regular | path: /VeraMono.ttf | size_px: 14 | cache: 256K
    + default-policy | root: /font

.
. ---- GUI stack (verbatim from sculpt/leitzentrale/default) ----
.

+ service Gui         | + default-policy | + child wm
+ service Capture     | + default-policy | + child nitpicker
+ service Event       | + default-policy | + child nitpicker
+ service ROM         | + default-policy | + child report_rom
+ service Report      | + default-policy | + child report_rom

+ start fader_config | ram: 1M
  + binary rom_filter
  + provides | + service ROM
  + config
  | + input leitzentrale_enabled | rom: leitzentrale | node: leitzentrale
  |   + attribute enabled
  | + output | node: config
  |   + if
  |     + has_value | input: leitzentrale_enabled | value: yes
  |   + then
  |     + attribute initial_fade_in_steps | value: 100
  |     + attribute fade_in_steps         | value: 20
  |     + attribute alpha                 | value: 210
  |   + else
  |     + attribute fade_out_steps        | value: 30
  |     + attribute alpha                 | value: 0
  + route
    + service ROM | label: leitzentrale | + parent | label: leitzentrale_enabled
    + any-service                       | + parent

+ start fader | ram: 100M
  + binary gui_fader
  + provides | + service Gui
  + route
    + service ROM | label: config | + child fader_config
    + service Gui                 | + child manager
    + any-service                 | + parent

+ start gui_fb | ram: 33M
  + provides
    + service Framebuffer
    + service Input
  + route
    + service ROM | label: config | + child report_rom
    + service Gui                 | + child fader
    + any-service                 | + parent

+ start nitpicker | caps: 200 | ram: 14M
  + provides
    + service Gui
    + service Capture
    + service Event
  .
  . Inner nitpicker runs headless (request_framebuffer: no,
  . request_input: no). In the merged sponge-alpha scenario the inner
  . GUI chain (sculpt_manager -> fader -> gui_fb) can stall under
  . resource contention, which deadlocks the nitpicker if it waits for
  . a Framebuffer/Input during construction. Without these dependencies
  . the nitpicker fully initializes and provides Capture, so lz_viewer
  . can stream the marker to the outer nitpicker. In the standalone
  . sponge-leitzentrale scenario the chain is reliable and lz_viewer
  . also works headless (it stamps the marker after capture).
  .
  + config | request_input: no | request_framebuffer: no
    + report | clicked: yes | touch: yes
    + background | color: #272f45
    + domain default | layer: 1 | content: client | label: no
                                  hover:   always | focus: click
    + default-policy | domain: default
    + capture
    + event
  + route
    + service Input              | + child gui_fb
    + service Framebuffer        | + child gui_fb
    + service ROM | label: focus | + child report_rom
    + service Report             | + child report_rom
    + any-service
      + parent
      + any-child

+ start report_rom | caps: 200 | ram: 4M
  + provides
    + service Report
    + service ROM
  + config | verbose: no
    + policy | label: decorator -> window_layout   | report: manager -> window_layout
    + policy | label: wm -> resize_request         | report: manager -> resize_request
    + policy | label: wm -> focus                  | report: manager -> wm_focus
    + policy | label: decorator -> pointer         | report: wm -> pointer
    + policy | label: manager -> window_list       | report: wm -> window_list
    + policy | label: manager -> decorator_margins | report: decorator -> decorator_margins
    + policy | label: nitpicker -> focus           | report: manager -> focus
    + policy | label: gui_fb -> config             | report: manager -> gui_fb_config
    + policy | label: manager -> clicked           | report: nitpicker -> clicked
    + policy | label: manager -> touch             | report: nitpicker -> touch
    + policy | label: runtime_view -> diag         | report: manager -> diag_dialog
    + policy | label: runtime_view -> network      | report: manager -> network_dialog
    + policy | label: runtime_view -> settings     | report: manager -> settings_dialog
    + policy | label: runtime_view -> system       | report: manager -> system_dialog
    + policy | label: runtime_view -> file_browser | report: manager -> file_browser_dialog
    + policy | label: runtime_view -> popup        | report: manager -> popup_dialog
    + policy | label: runtime_view -> panel        | report: manager -> panel_dialog
    + policy | label: runtime_view -> runtime      | report: manager -> runtime_dialog
    + policy | label: manager -> menu_hover        | report: runtime_view -> hover
    + policy | label_suffix: lz_model              | report: lz_watch -> lz_model
    + policy | label_suffix: lz_watch_result       | report: lz_watch -> result
    + policy | label_suffix: lz_watch_request      | report: lz_edit_probe -> lz_watch_request

+ start wm | caps: 150 | ram: 2M
  + provides
    + service Gui
    + service Report
    + service ROM
  + config
    + policy | label_prefix: decorator | role: decorator
    + default-policy
  + route
    + service ROM | label: resize_request | + child report_rom
    + service ROM | label: focus          | + child report_rom
    + service Report                      | + child report_rom
    + service Gui                         | + child nitpicker
    + any-service
      + parent
      + any-child

+ start runtime_view | caps: 330 | ram: 64M
  + binary menu_view
  + config
  | + report | hover: yes
  | + libc | stderr: /dev/log
  | + vfs
  |   + tar menu_view_style.tar
  |   + dir dev  | + log
  |   + dir font | + fs | label: font -> /
  | + dialog diag
  | + dialog file_browser
  | + dialog network
  | + dialog panel
  | + dialog popup
  | + dialog runtime
  | + dialog settings
  | + dialog system
  + route
    + service ROM | label_last: ld.lib.so | + parent
    + service ROM | label: menu_view_style.tar | + parent
    + service ROM | label: menu_view | + parent
    + service Report | label: hover | + child report_rom
    + service File_system | label: font -> / | + child font
    + service Gui | + child nitpicker
    + service ROM | + child report_rom
    + any-service
      + parent
      + any-child

+ start decorator | caps: 580 | ram: 20M
  + binary themed_decorator
  + config
  | + libc
  | + vfs
  |   + dir theme
  |   | + inline metadata
  |   |   + theme
  |   |     + aura  | top: 5 | bottom: 5 | left: 5 | right: 5
  |   |     + decor | top: 6 | bottom: 6 | left: 6 | right: 6
  |   | + rom default.png
  |   + dir dev
  |     + log
  |
  | + policy | label: log_view -> log              | decoration: yes | motion: 40
  | + policy | label: runtime_view -> settings     | decoration: no  | motion: 40
  | + policy | label: runtime_view -> system       | decoration: no  | motion: 40
  | + policy | label: runtime_view -> file_browser | decoration: no  | motion: 60
  | + policy | label: runtime_view -> network      | decoration: no  | motion: 40
  | + policy | label: runtime_view -> runtime      | decoration: no  | motion: 60
  | + policy | label: runtime_view -> diag         | decoration: no  | motion: 60
  | + policy | label: runtime_view -> popup        | decoration: no  | motion: 40
  | + policy | label: runtime_view -> panel        | decoration: no  | motion: 40
  | + policy | label_prefix: logo                  | decoration: no
  | + default-policy
  |
  + route
    + service ROM    | label: default.png       | + parent | label: drop_shadow.png
    + service ROM    | label: window_layout     | + child report_rom
    + service ROM    | label: pointer           | + child report_rom
    + service Report | label: decorator_margins | + child report_rom
    + service Report | label: hover             | + child report_rom
    + service Gui                               | + child wm
    + any-service                               | + parent

+ start model_fs_report | ram: 2M
  + binary fs_report
  + provides | + service Report
  + config | + vfs | + fs
  + route
    + service File_system | + child model_fs
    + any-service         | + parent

+ start manager | caps: 400 | ram: 8M
  + binary sculpt_manager
  + provides | + service Gui
  + route
    + service Report | label: runtime_config            | + child model_fs_report | label: init
    + service Report | label: depot_version_config      | + child model_fs_report | label: depot -> version
    + service Report | label: child/wifi_config         | + child model_fs_report | label: child -> wifi
    + service Report | label: child/font_config         | + child model_fs_report | label: child -> font
    + service Report | label: child/network_config      | + child model_fs_report | label: child -> network
    + service Report | label: fb_config                 | + child model_fs_report | label: fb
    + service Report | label: child/dir_query_config    | + child model_fs_report | label: child -> dir_query
    + service Report | label: child/gui_config          | + child model_fs_report | label: child -> gui
    + service Report | label: child/usb_config          | + child model_fs_report | label: child -> usb
    + service Report | label: system_config             | + child model_fs_report | label: system
    + service Report | label: install_config            | + child model_fs_report | label: install
    + service Report | label: child/depot_query         | + child model_fs_report | label: child -> depot_query
    + service Report | label: child/blueprint_query     | + child model_fs_report | label: child -> blueprint_query
    + service Report | label: option/managed            | + child model_fs_report | label: option -> managed
    + service Report                                    | + child report_rom
    + service ROM | label: config                  | + child model_rom | label: manager
    + service ROM | label_prefix: model ->         | + child model_rom
    + service ROM | label_prefix: report ->        | + child report_fs_rom
    + service ROM | label: nitpicker_focus         | + parent | label: focus
    + service ROM | label: nitpicker_hover         | + parent | label: hover
    + service ROM | label: leitzentrale            | + parent | label: leitzentrale_enabled
    + service ROM | label: clicked                 | + child report_rom
    + service ROM | label: touch                   | + child report_rom
    + service ROM | label: menu_hover              | + child report_rom
    + service ROM | label: window_list             | + child report_rom
    + service ROM | label: decorator_margins       | + child report_rom
    + service File_system | label_prefix: model    | + child model_fs
    + service File_system | label_prefix: report   | + child report_fs
    + service Gui                                  | + parent
    + any-service                                  | + parent

+ start lz_viewer | caps: 500 | ram: 32M
  .
  . Phase 6b criterion-3 viewer. Captures this subsystem's composited
  . output (the inner nitpicker — dialogs + backdrop) and presents it as a
  . Gui view on the OUTER nitpicker via the parent chain. Sits inside the
  . subsystem so Capture reaches the inner nitpicker as a sibling (the
  . cross-init Capture provide does not work); Gui routes to parent, which
  . reaches the outer nitpicker through lz_runtime -> top-level.
  . A distinct marker patch is stamped into each frame so lz_viz_probe can
  . unambiguously confirm the stream is live (not a color coincidence).
  .
  + route
    + service Capture | + child nitpicker
    + service Gui      | + parent
    + service Timer    | + parent
    + any-service
      + parent
      + any-child

+ start lz_watch | caps: 150 | ram: 8M
  .
  . Phase 6c change detector. Watches /deploy on the model fs (sibling),
  . keeps a baseline, reports divergence. Report/ROM go to the subsystem's
  . inner report_rom (local); lz_edit_probe reads lz_model from there and
  . writes lz_watch_request there. lz_watch_result is also local.
  .
  + route
    + service File_system | + child model_fs
    + service ROM | label_suffix: lz_watch_request | + child report_rom
    + service Timer | + parent
    + any-service
      + parent
      + any-child

+ start lz_edit_probe | caps: 150 | ram: 8M
  .
  . Phase 6c end-to-end driver. Edits /deploy (real fs change), reads
  . lz_model from the inner report_rom (lz_watch's divergence report),
  . reads lz_config from the parent (configd broadcast, downward) to verify
  . configd sync, writes lz_watch_request to the inner report_rom for
  . revert, and confirms the divergence clears.
  .
  + route
    + service File_system | + child model_fs
    + service Report | + child report_rom
    + service ROM | label_suffix: lz_config | + parent
    + service Timer | + parent
    + any-service
      + parent
      + any-child

+ start backdrop | caps: 150 | ram: 4M
  + config | width: 300 | height: 150
  | + libc
  | + vfs
  |   + rom genode_logo.png
  |
  | + fill  | color: #272f45
  | + image | png: genode_logo.png | alpha: 100
  |           anchor: bottom_right | xpos: -20 | ypos: -20
  + route
    + service Gui | + child wm | label: logo
    + any-service | + parent
-
